    <string name="about">Shell Installer installs APKs with shell-level privileges via Shizuku, on-device Wireless ADB, or root. It does not use the standard PackageInstaller UI and never needs the “install unknown apps” permission.</string>
    <string name="view_source">View source on GitHub</string>

